+The rendered pixel color $\gamma_j$ for pixel $j$ is computed via alpha blending of $N$ projected Gaussians sorted by depth:
+$$ \gamma_j = \sum_{i \in N} \alpha'_{ij} c_i \tau_{ij}, \quad \tau_{ij} = \prod_{k=1}^{i-1} (1 - \alpha'_{kj}) $$
